X:1
T:I'm But A Stranger Here
T:ST EDMUND SULLIVAN
C:Music: Arthur Seymour Sullivan, 1872 · Words: Thomas Rawson Taylor, 1836
S:Open Hymnal Project ABC (openhymnal.org; marked public domain), melody line with every stanza as printed there; their source: "Church Praise, with Tunes", 1885 Hymn 391. Words found there, too.. No second score was available to cross-check the melody.
